'" Test new features example `test_new_features.cpp`
@startuml test_new_features
title Test new features: smoke tests for new APIs
actor CI as Main
participant "Example (test_new_features)" as Example
participant "microla::NewAPI" as NewAPI

Main -> Example: run smoke tests
Example -> NewAPI: call new functions with simple inputs
NewAPI -> Example: return outputs
Example -> Example: basic assertions
Example -> Main: summary (failures if any)

note right
  Quick checks to catch regressions early in CI
end note
@enduml
